WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.250
In the previous verses of this chapter,

2
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.375
Lord Krishna had said

3
00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:37.000
that control of the mind is necessary for yoga,

4
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.041
and this can be done through the intellect.

5
00:00:40.041 --> 00:00:44.041
And then in the previous verse,
 Arjuna expressed his doubt.

6
00:00:44.041 --> 00:00:47.333
Here Arjuna, expanding that same doubt,

7
00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.416
asks about all the obstacles

8
00:00:48.416 --> 00:00:51.500
related to the mind.

9
00:00:56.416 --> 00:00:57.875
In this verse,

10
00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.875
Arjuna, expressing his helplessness,

11
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:02.750
says to Lord Krishna – O Krishna!

12
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:07.250
The mind is so restless and turbulent,
 so powerful and stubborn.

13
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:08.666
Being able to control the mind

14
00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:11.583
seems even more difficult to me

15
00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:13.750
than controlling the wind.

16
00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.958
To describe his distress,

17
00:01:15.958 --> 00:01:17.208
Arjuna explains the nature of the mind

18
00:01:17.208 --> 00:01:20.000
with these four words:

19
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.541
Chañchalam – meaning restless –

20
00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:25.541
just as a restless child doesn't sit calmly

21
00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:29.125
in one place, similarly the mind also

22
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:32.416
wanders from one thought to another.

23
00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:33.833
This restlessness of the mind

24
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:36.208
seems harmless,

25
00:01:36.208 --> 00:01:37.041
but many times

26
00:01:37.041 --> 00:01:40.250
can also put one in great danger.

27
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.208
Pramāthi –

28
00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:46.333
meaning turbulent or completely uncontrolled.

29
00:01:46.333 --> 00:01:47.958
Like someone insane,

30
00:01:47.958 --> 00:01:49.375
who loses their control

31
00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:51.500
in the force of emotions.

32
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:54.416
Many times this very madness 
makes people do such bad

33
00:01:54.416 --> 00:01:58.833
things that they never even thought of.

34
00:01:58.833 --> 00:02:00.750
Balavat –

35
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.625
meaning powerful – the mind is also strong.

36
00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:07.500
Now think, if this powerful mind
 loses its control like a madman,

37
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.500
then a person

38
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:11.541
won't be able to stop it.

39
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:16.041
Like such a storm that will blow everything away.

40
00:02:16.041 --> 00:02:19.041
Dṛḍham – meaning stubborn –

41
00:02:19.041 --> 00:02:21.291
if the mind becomes stubborn,

42
00:02:21.291 --> 00:02:22.791
then before it no logic

43
00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:24.291
or knowledge works.

44
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:25.458
And this very stubbornness

45
00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:27.750
has destroyed many warriors.

46
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.166
For example, think –

47
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:32.125
the cause of Ravana's destruction was also

48
00:02:32.125 --> 00:02:34.375
his stubbornness.

49
00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:36.583
And Arjuna compares such
 an uncontrolled, powerful

50
00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:40.166
and stubborn mind to the wind.

51
00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:41.541
His meaning is just this –

52
00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:43.916
that being able to stop a fierce storm

53
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:45.708
seems impossible,

54
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:47.125
and being able to stop the mind

55
00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:49.500
is even more difficult than that.

56
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.500
Arjuna is a great warrior, powerful,

57
00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:53.750
knowledgeable,

58
00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:54.500
yet

59
00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.458
is feeling helpless in being able to

60
00:02:56.458 --> 00:02:58.541
maintain control over the mind.

61
00:02:58.541 --> 00:03:00.625
And if this is happening with Arjuna,

62
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:03.083
then from this only this truth comes forward –

63
00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:04.583
that control over the mind

64
00:03:04.583 --> 00:03:05.791
is one of the biggest challenges

65
00:03:05.791 --> 00:03:08.250
of human life.

66
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.791
But where there are challenges,

67
00:03:10.791 --> 00:03:14.166
there is also Lord Krishna's guidance.

68
00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:15.333
And going forward,

69
00:03:15.333 --> 00:03:15.916
Lord Krishna

70
00:03:15.916 --> 00:03:19.000
will resolve all these doubts of Arjuna

71
00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.333
and guide all of us too.

72
00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:27.750
In life,

73
00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:30.916
many times you'll experience

74
00:03:30.916 --> 00:03:33.083
when thoughts aren't stopping,

75
00:03:33.083 --> 00:03:35.458
desires aren't ending, as if

76
00:03:35.458 --> 00:03:40.375
the mind has completely gone out of control.

77
00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:42.958
All this is exactly

78
00:03:42.958 --> 00:03:45.958
as Arjuna described.

79
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:48.541
Many times it's also possible

80
00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:51.625
that even knowing the right decision,

81
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:55.625
the mind will take you toward
 the wrong decision.

82
00:03:55.625 --> 00:04:00.125
When the mind starts moving
 contrary to your sense.

83
00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:02.250
For example,

84
00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:04.208
sense says

85
00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:07.916
that you have to complete
 some important work,

86
00:04:07.916 --> 00:04:10.250
it should be finished,

87
00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.416
but the mind will distract,

88
00:04:12.416 --> 00:04:16.916
will pull you toward some entertaining program,

89
00:04:16.916 --> 00:04:22.416
the mind will say this work can be done later too.

90
00:04:22.416 --> 00:04:26.541
This has also happened with you, right? Tell me?

91
00:04:26.541 --> 00:04:30.083
Tell me, nothing is hidden from me.

92
00:04:30.083 --> 00:04:33.000
But don't be discouraged.

93
00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.583
It will take time,

94
00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:38.625
but there is also a solution.

95
00:04:38.625 --> 00:04:39.625
And the

96
00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:44.000
first and biggest step of the solution is accepting

97
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:48.291
that you are caught in the clutches of the mind.

98
00:04:48.291 --> 00:04:51.750
Many people don't even accept this.

99
00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:56.375
Think – the enemy will only be defeated, right,

100
00:04:56.375 --> 00:04:59.916
when you recognize that enemy?

101
00:04:59.916 --> 00:05:05.125
Arjuna is recognizing this enemy,
 meaning the mind,

102
00:05:05.125 --> 00:05:07.625
also knows its power.

103
00:05:07.625 --> 00:05:10.250
So now is the time to give him

104
00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:13.583
proper guidance.

105
00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:15.708
And this guidance

106
00:05:15.708 --> 00:05:20.250
I will give to him and to you too.

107
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.666
So just first recognize

108
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:27.291
that you are trapped under
 the control of the mind,

109
00:05:27.291 --> 00:05:30.041
accept this.

110
00:05:30.041 --> 00:05:31.041
By doing this,

111
00:05:31.041 --> 00:05:34.583
your beginning on the right path has happened.

112
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:37.416
Just now you have to keep walking

113
00:05:37.416 --> 00:05:40.833
on the path shown by me.

114
00:05:45.416 --> 00:05:47.541
The mind is restless,

115
00:05:47.541 --> 00:05:50.625
it must be stopped from wandering.

116
00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:53.750
A person also knows this.

117
00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.000
But nowadays in society,

118
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.708
instead of calming the mind, people
 are absorbed in means

119
00:05:59.708 --> 00:06:05.083
that make it even more turbulent.

120
00:06:05.083 --> 00:06:06.500
As if someone

121
00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:11.458
in a burning house, instead of
extinguishing the fire with water,

122
00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:14.666
is pouring ghee into that very fire.

123
00:06:14.666 --> 00:06:17.791
Don't be surprised,

124
00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:22.291
this must be happening around you too.

125
00:06:22.291 --> 00:06:24.208
Or perhaps

126
00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:27.750
is happening with you?

127
00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:29.916
Think –

128
00:06:29.916 --> 00:06:32.291
what appears in people's hands

129
00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:36.166
every moment nowadays?

130
00:06:36.166 --> 00:06:39.958
Their devices. Like

131
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:42.083
their phone.

132
00:06:42.083 --> 00:06:44.083
While traveling,

133
00:06:44.083 --> 00:06:47.250
you'll see people instead of talking to you

134
00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.958
with eyes fixed on that phone.

135
00:06:50.958 --> 00:06:55.250
Are all people watching
 educational things on the phone,

136
00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:59.916
or some spiritual program?

137
00:06:59.916 --> 00:07:01.750
You also know

138
00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:04.208
that this is not at all so.

139
00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:06.833
Someone is watching colorful movies,

140
00:07:06.833 --> 00:07:08.958
someone is playing something,

141
00:07:08.958 --> 00:07:11.541
and someone is just randomly moving fingers

142
00:07:11.541 --> 00:07:13.583
here and there watching

143
00:07:13.583 --> 00:07:15.625
who knows what.

144
00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:19.250
Many people, even ignoring their family 
members sitting together at home,

145
00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.333
or even their children,

146
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:26.583
are seen trapped in the web of these devices.

147
00:07:26.583 --> 00:07:30.416
Will the mind become calm from all this?

148
00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:34.875
Will this take you toward your goal?

149
00:07:34.875 --> 00:07:40.916
Will all this strengthen family relationships?

150
00:07:40.916 --> 00:07:45.583
The answer to all these is no.

151
00:07:45.583 --> 00:07:48.500
Remember, these devices

152
00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:52.250
will definitely give you a
 few moments of pleasure,

153
00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:55.000
but if control is not maintained,

154
00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:58.166
they will only make the mind turbulent.

155
00:07:58.166 --> 00:08:00.333
Instead of getting peace,

156
00:08:00.333 --> 00:08:02.458
only restlessness will increase.

157
00:08:02.458 --> 00:08:06.000
Mutual relationships will weaken.

158
00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.833
Entertainment is not bad,

159
00:08:07.833 --> 00:08:10.875
nor is the use of these devices bad.

160
00:08:10.875 --> 00:08:15.333
But some limit must be
 placed on such entertainment.

161
00:08:15.333 --> 00:08:18.208
And yes, these devices can also be used

162
00:08:18.208 --> 00:08:19.833
for knowledge enhancement

163
00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:23.291
or for spirituality.

164
00:08:23.291 --> 00:08:26.666
Society today must think –

165
00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:30.791
are these devices serving us?

166
00:08:30.791 --> 00:08:35.333
Or have we ourselves become
 slaves of these devices?

167
00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:40.541
Only one who understands this difference
 and learns to maintain control

168
00:08:40.541 --> 00:08:43.500
will be able to experience peace

169
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:46.791
and concentration in life.

170
00:08:46.791 --> 00:08:50.333
Now the right choice

171
00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:51.666
is yours to make.

172
00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.875
Arjuna is a great warrior

173
00:08:58.875 --> 00:09:01.166
and scholar,

174
00:09:01.166 --> 00:09:04.375
yet he is expressing his doubt

175
00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:08.375
to me without any hesitation.

176
00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:11.125
Three things must be understood here –

177
00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:15.500
first, his purpose is clear,

178
00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:18.416
he wants guidance.

179
00:09:18.416 --> 00:09:21.750
Second, there's no pride in him,

180
00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:25.375
but the desire to learn.

181
00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:28.541
Third thing, he knows

182
00:09:28.541 --> 00:09:32.333
that I love him

183
00:09:32.333 --> 00:09:34.791
and will definitely help.

184
00:09:34.791 --> 00:09:36.291
These three things 

185
00:09:36.291 --> 00:09:41.291
are equally important 
in professional settings too.

186
00:09:41.291 --> 00:09:42.000
If you

187
00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.625
are failing repeatedly in some work,

188
00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:49.083
then like Arjuna, without hesitation

189
00:09:49.083 --> 00:09:51.000
ask for help from some experienced colleague

190
00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:53.833
or official.

191
00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:57.416
And if you're feeling hesitant about this,

192
00:09:57.416 --> 00:10:00.916
then there can be only two reasons –

193
00:10:00.916 --> 00:10:04.708
Either you have the pride of not asking for help,

194
00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:06.458
or the fear

195
00:10:06.458 --> 00:10:10.375
that your senior officials will criticize.

196
00:10:10.375 --> 00:10:13.875
If there's pride, then like Arjuna,

197
00:10:13.875 --> 00:10:17.583
give up this pride. Ask for help.

198
00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:19.416
Achieving the goal

199
00:10:19.416 --> 00:10:21.500
is more important

200
00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.416
than pride.

201
00:10:23.416 --> 00:10:26.375
And if there's fear of senior officials,

202
00:10:26.375 --> 00:10:29.791
then here, people appointed
 in leadership positions

203
00:10:29.791 --> 00:10:32.708
must create such an environment

204
00:10:32.708 --> 00:10:36.375
where their colleagues can without any fear

205
00:10:36.375 --> 00:10:39.041
talk to them.

206
00:10:39.041 --> 00:10:40.875
The organization that

207
00:10:40.875 --> 00:10:44.125
creates an atmosphere of cooperation

208
00:10:44.125 --> 00:10:47.500
and sensitivity for its employees,

209
00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:50.916
only that can make continuous progress.
